e: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-indent: 8px;min-height: 1em;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<strong style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-family: Optima-Regular, PingFangTC-light;letter-spacing: 2px;visibility: visible;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n            关于El Diviso\n           </span>\n</strong>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          El Diviso位于慧兰的Pitalito镇，庄园的主人Jose Uribe Lasso为了远离暴力的生活环境，从娜玲珑搬到了Pitalito，于2000年初购得了El Diviso，开始新的生活篇章。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          选择慧兰，是因为肥沃的土壤与健康多样的生态环境，给了Jose信心，只要努力，种咖啡或者其它任何作物都可以很好的生活下去。\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TSFhvHVicoryqeKoSkMibXbChXBpTHAkYcZQd0eSKkcNicxiafCB2MWQohgkpPUfP4kfb4wDj7E47RuQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"white-space: normal;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          Jose将庄园分割了不同的地块分别给它的3个儿子，让他们选择想种的咖啡品种，鼓励他们自己选择合适的处理加工方式，现在庄园里有种植的品种有瑰夏、波旁希爪、卡杜拉、卡杜拉奇罗索、爪哇、粉波旁以及一种叫Bourbon Aji辣椒波旁的波旁品种。\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          现在第三代年仅24岁的\n          <span style=\"color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;text-decoration: none solid rgb(34, 34, 34);\">\n           Nestor Lasso负责庄园的加工处理和运营。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TSFhvHVicoryqeKoSkMibXbCz14MEzick6QCPT5MYmNicgglROmFhPbBpvJTVW3187tw56XWSGsHqHiag/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n           关于这个批次的处理方式\n          </span>\n</strong>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          这个批次采用了多重的厌氧发酵， 首先鲜果经过浮选筛选后，进行第一次36个小时左右的低温17摄氏度左右的厌氧发酵（塑胶袋或者桶内）；接下来，将咖啡果转入可密封的水箱中浸泡入40度左右的热水，投入激活好的酿酒酵母，密封后发酵72小时；随后排出液体，让咖啡果在密封环境下发酵12小时左右，最后用60度左右的热水清洗咖啡果来终止发酵，然后开始后续的干燥过程。\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);clear: both;min-height: 1em;text-indent: 8px;visibility: visible;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;visibility: visible;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          干燥时也采用了三段式，先用机械干燥到含水率18%左右，再转移到全黑的房屋中装袋（黑色袋子不透光）静置60小时后，取出再静置干燥至含水率11%收储。\n         </span>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7TSFhvHVicoryqeKoSkMibXbCPPWG0BjjrJhloGQOldUCOSTyOCdgKbjhia9nFFEyZhIWGlqU7Xibae4w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          更多咖啡豆选购，请关注收藏小程序和淘宝店铺哦～\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;clear: both;min-height: 1em;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n          <br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style='outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;'>\n<span style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;font-size: 14px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\">\n<br style=\"outline: 0px;max-width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;\"/>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Gr457cyFia7Q09FO8svc4MbsT6kYe0icjVt0iafAKEvQb4V0sg5ELeaSJuChicNO6jr9zxGVFVu7wDwt3ibVQgXa5ow/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1&amp;wx_co=1\" style='outline: 0px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;box-sizing: border-box !important;overflow-wrap: break-word !important;visibility: visible !important;width: 431px !important;'/>\n</span>\n</p>\n<p style=\"display: none;\">\n<mp-style-type data-value=\"3\">\n</mp-style-type>\n</p>\n</div>",
